    "delivery": "Read-only staged mark/owner preparation, whole-tuple paragraph/heading apply/remove/toggle, one mixed origin transaction, exact-state staleness and typed profile/target rejection. Qualified v2 block kind accepted by existing fixed-pair text/structure commands. Projection uses qualified observer/inheritance mapping without new storage. Block profile test accepts a scoped output directory so historical artifacts stay unchanged.",
    "API": [
      "BlockFormatCommand",
      "Document::prepare_format_batch",
      "Document::can_format_batch",
      "Document::commit_format (existing marks-only entrypoints retained)"
    ],
    "block_semantics": "Remove resets to paragraph. Toggle resets all selected owners when all match, otherwise applies to all. Mark actions then block actions each run in input order; staged blocks observe prior first-owner changes. Duplicate owner IDs count once for semantics; empty block selections need no text anchors. Explicit split-owner formatting ends inheritance even when equal to the inherited value; absent ordinary paragraph defaults remain read-only."
  },
